In this In Vitro analysis, Amoxicillin produces potent 1:1 complexes with Vildagliptin which is represented as ‘^’ shaped curves that confirms the interactions between them.
And by the antimicrobial activity, it is confirmed that the zone of inhibition of Amoxicillin with vildagliptin is reduced due to interaction between them.
As a result,we can not take both of the drug together due to interactions.
